# Copy-paste prompt (hard)

When a handoff fence is required:

- Exactly one fenced block, tag `text`
- English only inside
- Complete and self-contained (not a checklist fragment)
- Last thing in the message; nothing after the closing fence
- The Russian report stays outside the fence

Do not add a second fence for examples, diffs, or "also this". If no handoff is required, emit no `text` fence.

Canon: `.ai/shared/DEVELOPER_PROMPT_CANON.md`.
